\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Holy, holy, holy, Lord God Almighty!
\par Early in the morning 
\par our song shall rise to Thee;
\par Holy, holy, holy, merciful and mighty,
\par God in Three Persons, blessed Trinity!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Holy, holy, holy, all the saints adore Thee,
\par Casting down their golden crowns 
\par around the glassy sea;
\par Cherubim and seraphim falling down before Thee,
\par Who wert, and art, and evermore shalt be.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Holy, holy, holy; though the darkness hide Thee,
\par Though the eye of sinful man 
\par Thy glory may not see,
\par Only Thou art holy; there is none beside Thee
\par Perfect in power, in love, and purity!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Holy, holy, holy, Lord God Almighty!
\par All Thy works shall praise Thy name 
\par in earth and sky and sea;
\par Holy, holy, holy, merciful and mighty,
\par God in Three Persons, blessed Trinity!
\par                                            Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

